{
  "schema": "melusina.installer-publish-binding-vectors.v1",
  "notes": [
    "Golden vectors for internal/installerpublish.Preimage and Digest: the exact bytes an installer publication envelope binds as its body hash (POST /publish/installer).",
    "preimage is Binding as compact JSON in fieldOrder, with artifactSha256 lowercased; digest is the lowercase hex SHA-256 of preimage. Neither may change without a new binding schema.",
    "Every value is a fixture: artifact digests are sha256 of fixed 'store-test-fixture:' labels and the mints and programs are base58 of sha256 of such labels. None names anything that exists.",
    "Consumers that recompute the binding outside this package (the deployer's firststoregeneration.InstallerPublishBindingDigest) copy this file byte for byte at their Store pin and assert every vector and refusal."
  ],
